@startuml
title US010 - "As a User, I want to register %n()a new publication in the system" %n()SSD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox

' --- Actor and participants ---
actor User
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

' --- System dialog ---
User -> System: I want to register %n()a new publication
activate System
System --> User: Fill in the %n()publication's %n()information
deactivate System
User -> System: publicationType, %n()identifier, %n()publicationYear, %n()title, author, %n()publisher, edition, %n()genre
activate System
System --> User: You have %n()successfully %n()registered a %n()new publication.
deactivate System

deactivate System
@enduml